# Conductor "Files to copy" — gitignored files seeded into every NEW workspace.
#
# Git worktrees only carry TRACKED files, so gitignored-but-required files must
# be listed here to be copied from the repo root into each new workspace. This
# file holds PATHS ONLY — never secret values — so it's safe to commit.
#
# NOTE: creating this file overrides Conductor's built-in default `.env*` copy,
# so `.env*` is re-listed below to preserve that behavior.

# Google OAuth client credentials. Baked into the Rust binary at COMPILE time
# via include_str! in apps/writer-tauri/src-tauri/src/google_oauth.rs — a
# missing file is a hard compile error, so every workspace that builds the app
# needs them present.
apps/writer-tauri/src-tauri/secrets/google_client_id
apps/writer-tauri/src-tauri/secrets/google_client_secret

# Env files (preserves the default `.env*` copy + the signing env `pnpm release`
# reads).
.env*
